#
# 0.2.0
#
WailoModuleDescLong = Keeps Dolibarr contacts and Wailo contacts in sync, both ways, every 5 minutes. Requires a Wailo account (Enterprise offer) and an API key.
WailoSetupIntro = Contacts created or modified on one side are copied to the other side at each pass. A contact deleted in Dolibarr goes to the Wailo trash (an administrator can restore it). A contact removed in Wailo is never deleted from Dolibarr: it becomes inactive, with a private note, and active again if it comes back in Wailo. Inactive and private Dolibarr contacts are not sent.
WailoApiKeyHelp = Created in the Wailo Enterprise space, "API access" screen. A trial key (wlo_test_) opens a sandbox of fictitious contacts: use it on a test Dolibarr only, never on a Dolibarr holding real contacts (the fictitious contacts would be added to it). The key is stored encrypted and is no longer shown on this page (Dolibarr administrators can still read it in Setup > Other setup, hidden constants): leave empty to keep the current one.
WailoSyncNote = Synchronise the public note
WailoSyncNoteHelp = Off by default. When on, the public note of the Dolibarr contact and the "about" text of Wailo are copied both ways, as plain text only (formatting is lost, %s characters at most), and become visible on the phones of the Wailo enterprise.
WailoErrorHostNotAllowed = Only a Wailo address is accepted (https://...wailo.app): the key is never sent to another server.
WailoErrorKeyRequiredForHost = The API address changes server: type the API key again (the saved key is never sent to a new server on its own).
WailoErrorPassRunning = A synchronisation is running: try again in a moment (nothing was saved).
WailoSyncResult_deferred = Wailo asks to slow down: the synchronisation stopped and resumes at the next pass.
WailoWaiting_removals = %s contacts were removed from Wailo at once: making more than 5 Dolibarr contacts inactive needs your confirmation.
WailoQuarantineTitle = Contacts in quarantine
WailoQuarantineHelp = Refused by one side: they are not sent again until they change. The other contacts keep being synchronised.
WailoRemovedNote = Removed from Wailo on %s: contact made inactive by Wailo for Dolibarr.
WailoBackNote = Back in Wailo on %s: contact made active again by Wailo for Dolibarr.
WailoBackNoteInactive = Back in Wailo on %s: contact left inactive (it was already inactive before its removal from Wailo).
WailoLogRateLimitedDeferred = Wailo asks to slow down (%s s): pass stopped, it resumes at the next run
WailoLogConfirmed = Confirmation used: %s (%s contacts)
WailoLogNeedsConfirm_first_push = %s Dolibarr contacts to send to Wailo for the first time: waiting for a confirmation
WailoLogNeedsConfirm_too_many = %s operations to send to Wailo (more than 50): waiting for a confirmation
WailoLogNeedsConfirm_deletes = %s contacts missing from Dolibarr at once: no mass deletion without a confirmation
WailoLogNeedsConfirm_removals = %s contacts removed from Wailo at once: no mass deactivation without a confirmation
WailoLogOrphanLinks = %s linked contacts are no longer in Wailo: handled as removals
WailoLogPendingDeletion = Wailo %s: its Dolibarr contact %s was deleted, deletion waiting to be sent (not created again)
WailoLogW2DDeactivated = Wailo to Dolibarr: Wailo %s removed, Dolibarr contact %s made inactive (not deleted)
WailoLogW2DReactivated = Wailo to Dolibarr: Wailo %s back, Dolibarr contact %s made active again (no duplicate)
WailoLogW2DBackStillInactive = Wailo to Dolibarr: Wailo %s back, Dolibarr contact %s left inactive (it was before the removal)
WailoLogW2DBackNewId = Wailo to Dolibarr: Wailo %s back under a new id (old %s), same Dolibarr contact %s
WailoLogAsleepReactivatedInDolibarr = Wailo %s, removed from Wailo: its Dolibarr contact %s was made active in Dolibarr, sent back to Wailo as a new contact
WailoLogAsleepLinkForgotten = Wailo %s, removed from Wailo: its Dolibarr contact %s was deleted, link forgotten (nothing sent to Wailo)
WailoLogW2DPaired = Initial import: Dolibarr contact %s paired with Wailo %s, empty fields filled: %s
WailoLogQuarantine = Quarantine %s: %s
WailoLogD2WRefused = Dolibarr to Wailo: refused (%s)
